#: data/io.github.dragonGR.Dropzone.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid "Instant in-flight download cancellation when sharing is stopped"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.dragonGR.Dropzone.metainfo.xml.in:71
msgid ""
"Layout stabilization with tabular numeric figures to eliminate header jitter"
